Thank you for your voice mail.  I saw that you posted the same question to S-NEWS about obtaining 0:00:00.000.  The response from David Lorenz appears to be correct (you need to expand the GUI window).  If you do not like the current formatting of the timeDate variable you can change the format from the command line.

 

