Consider the use of 'get' and 'assign':

function(OLD, NEW){
      assign(paste('program1', NEW, sep=''), frame=0) <-
modify(get(paste('program1', OLD, sep=''), frame=0))
......
}

You might also consider the use of 'list' to collect the data together in
one place and make it easier to reference.
