I think you're looking for deparse(substitute(x)) and ?mtext:

 myPlot <- function(dat, x, y) {
        attach(dat)
        ## par(mfrow = c(3,2))
        plot(x, y, main = "Smoothing splines")
        mtext(text = deparse(substitute(dat)), side = 3)
        lines(smooth.spline(x, y))
 }

--sundar

