From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Mon Jan 31 15:23:25 2005
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian Ripley)
Date: Mon, 31 Jan 2005 15:23:25 +0000
Subject: Re: not displaying p-values: very basic questions...
In-Reply-To: <20050131142939.48007.qmail@web50606.mail.yahoo.com>
References: <20050131142939.48007.qmail@web50606.mail.yahoo.com>
